<title>HONG KONG: HK Land auction-Latest Stanley bid up to HK$5.4bln.</title>
<headline>HK Land auction-Latest Stanley bid up to HK$5.4bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bidding for a 571,848 square foot site in beachside Stanley on southern Hong Kong island continued on Tuesday, with the latest bid at HK$5.4 billion.</p>
<p>Bidding for the plot of land opened at HK$5.2 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
